What the backend supplies

the atmosphere (tas, pr) for smbpal, or the surface mass balance directly;
the ocean at the shelf base (T_shlf, S_shlf and their anomalies), interpolated from the reference ocean with the marine-shelf parameters, so step_shelf passes it straight to the marine shelf;
subglacial discharge Qd, landed on Yelmo by couple_to_yelmo.
